launch, due to internal antitrust concerns. The program offered credit support in')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a047f7-4d61-7483-828a-d29130de62c7', 'benzinga.com', 'Marvell Technology Stock Slides: Data Center Strength Overshadowed by Valuation Concerns', \\\"Marvell Technology Stock Slides: Data Center Strength Overshadowed by Valuation Concerns\\\\nMarvell Technology reported strong Q2 earnings and raised guidance, but shares fell ~8% premarket as investors digested clarification that Google warrant revenue is already included in next year's projections, a\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a048cf-14af-7563-937e-da86edc751ec', 'benzinga.com', 'Microsoft Runs On It, Nvidia Validates It: IREN CEO Says the Real Edge Is Owning the Entire AI Stack', \\\"Microsoft Runs On It, Nvidia Validates It: IREN CEO Says the Real Edge Is Owning the Entire AI Stack\\\\nIREN's fiscal 2026 earnings call highlighted milestones: Microsoft began running AI workloads on IREN's infrastructure, Horizon 1 delivered, and Nvidia certified Mirantis as an inaugural Nvidia Certi\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a049f6-2a91-7c82-9b84-7e12bd8a139b', 'benzinga.com', 'Warsh Sparks Rate-Hike Bets, Nvidia Reaffirms AI Growth Story: This Week on Wall Street', \\\"Warsh Sparks Rate-Hike Bets, Nvidia Reaffirms AI Growth Story: This Week on Wall Street\\\\nThe article covers multiple market-moving events: Fed Chair Warsh's hawkish Jackson Hole speech raising rate-hike bets, Nvidia's blowout earnings with strong guidance, CrowdStrike's record quarterly results and s\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a04ca7-93dc-76d0-81a4-942b5b2b07ff', 'benzinga.com', 'Hugging Face’s $399 Robot Ducks Racks Up $2.6 Million in Sales as Nvidia Deal Buzz Grows', \\\"Hugging Face’s $399 Robot Ducks Racks Up $2.6 Million in Sales as Nvidia Deal Buzz Grows\\\\nHugging Face's Microduck robot, developed by Pollen Robotics, generated over $2.6 million in orders within 24 hours of launch, signaling strong consumer demand for AI-powered home robots. The launch highlights t\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a052a6-717b-78a2-8d80-366629c5199c', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Weekend Tech Roundup: CXMT's 874% Revenue Surge, Apple's New Macs, Nvidia's Q2 Beat and More\\\", \\\"Weekend Tech Roundup: CXMT's 874% Revenue Surge, Apple's New Macs, Nvidia's Q2 Beat and More\\\\nWeekend tech roundup covering CXMT's massive revenue surge and Pentagon lawsuit, Apple's new Mac launches, and Q2 earnings beats from Nvidia, CrowdStrike, and Salesforce.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0582d-e791-7982-bcf9-7f7da0ed26c0', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Elon Musk Is Trying to Break GE Vernova's AI Power Bottleneck\\\", \\\"Elon Musk Is Trying to Break GE Vernova's AI Power Bottleneck\\\\nSpaceX is building a foundry in Texas to cast gas-turbine blades and vanes in-house, targeting a supply-chain bottleneck that GE Vernova says is limiting AI power projects. Musk confirmed the move, which could accelerate turbine availabil\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a058bf-e042-7760-a268-60a63cd2a58a', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia's $3.5 Billion MediaTek Deal Revives the 'Circular Financing' Debate\\\", \\\"Nvidia's $3.5 Billion MediaTek Deal Revives the 'Circular Financing' Debate\\\\nNvidia announced a $3.5 billion investment in convertible bonds issued by MediaTek, deepening their partnership in AI infrastructure, AI PCs, and automotive computing. The deal has revived the 'circular financing' debate, wi\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a058e1-e2bc-7f13-aa15-65a022b69227', 'benzinga.com', 'Amazon Web Services Accelerates Middle East AI Push with Saudi Cloud Region Launch', 'Amazon Web Services Accelerates Middle East AI Push with Saudi Cloud Region Launch\\\\nAWS is accelerating its cloud and AI expansion in Saudi Arabia, preparing to launch a new Region in December, expanding its HUMAIN partnership, and scaling AI infrastructure. The article also notes Amazon stock dipped')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a05933-3ba3-7603-a8d7-fe5134dc6999', 'benzinga.com', 'OpenAI Got $5.5B in SB Energy Warrants to Lease Nvidia-Backed AI Data Centers', \\\"OpenAI Got $5.5B in SB Energy Warrants to Lease Nvidia-Backed AI Data Centers\\\\nOpenAI holds warrants in SoftBank's SB Energy valued at $5.5B, with Nvidia backing the data-center buildout with up to $105B in guarantees. SB Energy's draft IPO filing reveals a $400B backlog and nearly 9GW of contracted \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a05979-1431-78b0-91c0-3cfa94e6669f', 'benzinga.com', 'Trump’s Truth Social ETF Manager Is Betting Big on AI, Crypto and New ETFs', \\\"Trump’s Truth Social ETF Manager Is Betting Big on AI, Crypto and New ETFs\\\\nYorkville America, manager of Trump's Truth Social ETFs, launched the MANGOS Plus Index ETF (FRUT) on Monday, its first non-Truth Social product, combining AI platform companies with semiconductor/hardware names. The firm is \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a05ad4-feaa-7841-a12d-427b8db67711', 'benzinga.com', 'Anthropic Signs $35 Billion Cloud Agreement With Nvidia-Backed Lambda in Deal Where Chip Giant Holds the Lease: Report', 'Anthropic Signs $35 Billion Cloud Agreement With Nvidia-Backed Lambda in Deal Where Chip Giant Holds the Lease: Report\\\\nAnthropic has reportedly signed a $35 billion cloud-computing agreement with Nvidia-backed Lambda, which holds the lease for a Texas data center developed by Hut 8. The deal secures')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a05c5d-22ca-7021-b1e2-cc87f9cef144', 'benzinga.com', 'NVIDIA Moves Deeper Into Broadcom Territory — Without Building The Chip', 'NVIDIA Moves Deeper Into Broadcom Territory — Without Building The Chip\\\\nNVIDIA is expanding into custom AI chips with NVHBM, a new memory architecture that could challenge Broadcom and Marvell. The article reports analyst commentary and market reaction, with NVIDIA stock down 1.35% in premarket.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a05c92-e2d8-7682-8005-a3008e419ac5', 'benzinga.com', 'NVIDIA Widens Its AI Moat With MediaTek', 'NVIDIA announced a deeper partnership with MediaTek, including a $3.5B investment in convertible bonds, to expand NVLink Fusion technology into the custom AI chip market. This move positions NVIDIA to benefit from the growing trend of tech companies designing their own AI processors, while also incr')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a05d77-a4fb-75b3-ae81-305ea7043df3', 'benzinga.com', 'Micron’s Largest Production Base Faces Strike Over 83 Months’ Pay', 'Micron’s Largest Production Base Faces Strike Over 83 Months’ Pay\\\\nMicron workers in Taiwan threaten a strike over pay, with unions representing nearly 10,000 workers pushing for a walkout. The dispute poses a supply risk to memory production, especially HBM, amid booming AI demand.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a05da8-6334-7433-a01f-c05622ef15b2', 'benzinga.com', 'SpaceX Stock Rockets 32% in August: Inside the Turnaround', \\\"SpaceX Stock Rockets 32% in August: Inside the Turnaround\\\\nSpaceX stock rallied 32% in August, driven by a post-IPO lock-up expiry that didn't trigger a sell-off, a strong Q2 earnings beat, and an NVIDIA stake disclosure. The stock remains volatile with more share unlocks ahead.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a05dce-7a92-7db1-be20-b8f6dc3c54a1', 'benzinga.com', \\\"QUICK SPARK: This Startup Got AMD Chips to 80% of Nvidia's Speed at Half the Cost\\\", \\\"QUICK SPARK: This Startup Got AMD Chips to 80% of Nvidia's Speed at Half the Cost\\\\nWafer, a year-old startup, raised $40 million in Series A funding at a valuation above $200 million. The company optimizes AI inference on non-Nvidia chips, claiming to achieve 80% of Nvidia B200's throughput on AMD's \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a06020-2c04-7d10-ab63-f8aaea712368', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Jim Cramer Says 'WOW' as Dell Crushes Earnings; Patrick Moorhead Says the Company Is Doing 'Exactly What It Told Investors'\\\", \\\"Jim Cramer Says 'WOW' as Dell Crushes Earnings; Patrick Moorhead Says the Company Is Doing 'Exactly What It Told Investors'\\\\nDell reported blowout fiscal Q2 results, with adjusted EPS of $7.04 beating consensus by 43%, revenue up 58% YoY to $46.97B, and record AI server orders of $60.9B. The company \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a061cb-2f42-7992-ac0e-f581a77e89aa', 'benzinga.com', 'What Is Going On With Micron Tech Stock on Wednesday?', 'What Is Going On With Micron Tech Stock on Wednesday?\\\\nMicron faces potential labor strike in Taiwan over bonuses, with 80% employee support, while AI-driven memory demand keeps supply tight. Tariff risks and U.S. investment plans add to the narrative. Stock down 1.43% premarket.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a062c0-01f6-7c41-aeae-64e4767d140c', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia Nears $14 Billion Hugging Face Deal After Earlier Rejection', \\\"Nvidia Nears $14 Billion Hugging Face Deal After Earlier Rejection\\\\nNvidia is in advanced talks to acquire Hugging Face for $12.9 billion plus ~$1 billion for employee retention, potentially closing as soon as this week. The deal would expand Nvidia's software ecosystem and cloud services, though no \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a06373-c9d4-7463-8937-b12b485fce46', 'benzinga.com', 'SpaceX AI Buildout Shows Cracks as Musk Shakes Up Data Center Team', 'SpaceX AI Buildout Shows Cracks as Musk Shakes Up Data Center Team\\\\nSpaceX has reshuffled its data-center leadership after reliability problems at its AI facilities, raising concerns about meeting a Sept. 30 deadline to deliver 110,000 Nvidia GPUs to Google under a $920 million-per-month compute deal')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a064d9-dd0f-7b73-a3d4-771393e54367', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Snowflake, Broadcom, Hewlett Packard Enterprise, Palantir and Nvidia: Why These 5 Stocks Are on Investors' Radars Today\\\", \\\"Snowflake, Broadcom, Hewlett Packard Enterprise, Palantir and Nvidia: Why These 5 Stocks Are on Investors' Radars Today\\\\nA market wrap highlighting five trending stocks on Wednesday, Sept. 2, 2026. Snowflake, Broadcom, and Hewlett Packard Enterprise reported quarterly earnings with revenue and EPS be\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a066af-38a9-72c3-aa44-c37830e2cf40', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is Broadcom Stock Falling Thursday?', 'Why Is Broadcom Stock Falling Thursday?\\\\nBroadcom reported fiscal Q3 earnings that beat estimates, but its Q4 revenue guidance fell short of consensus, causing the stock to drop over 3% premarket. Analysts view the quarter as strong, with attention on future AI revenue outlook.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a066e7-540f-7ea3-b63d-a9f2204b9851', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Jim Cramer Sees Broadcom's Business Exploding as CEO Hock Tan Says Custom OpenAI Chip Beats Nvidia's Grace Blackwell at ‘Half the Cost’\\\", \\\"Jim Cramer Sees Broadcom's Business Exploding as CEO Hock Tan Says Custom OpenAI Chip Beats Nvidia's Grace Blackwell at ‘Half the Cost’\\\\nBroadcom reported strong Q3 earnings with AI revenue surging 221% YoY to $16.7B, but issued soft Q4 guidance. CEO Hock Tan claimed its custom OpenAI chip outperform\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a06765-0d72-7fa3-b5c8-c8eab43156ec', 'benzinga.com', 'Microsoft, Amazon, Google Circle $50B Chinese AI Upstart as It Files for IPO', 'Microsoft, Amazon, Google Circle $50B Chinese AI Upstart as It Files for IPO\\\\nMoonshot AI has confidentially filed for a Hong Kong IPO to raise ~$3B at a $50B valuation, and is in early talks with Microsoft, Amazon, and Google for revenue-sharing deals on its Kimi K3 model. Alibaba, a major backer an')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a067e0-fba6-7151-a1d7-cdaa4be3c6f0', 'benzinga.com', 'Broadcom Q2 AI Revenue Grows Over 200%, Guidance Restricted By Supply Constraints', 'Broadcom Q2 AI Revenue Grows Over 200%, Guidance Restricted By Supply Constraints\\\\nBroadcom reported strong fiscal Q3 results with revenue and EPS beating estimates, but shares fell 5.44% due to supply constraints and in-line Q4 guidance. AI revenue surged 221% YoY to $16.7B, and the company raised i')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a06807-51c7-7562-8f8e-ba5f98407ffd', 'benzinga.com', 'NVIDIA Buys Hugging Face, the Heart of Open-Source AI', \\\"NVIDIA Buys Hugging Face, the Heart of Open-Source AI\\\\nNVIDIA has agreed to acquire Hugging Face, a leading open-source AI platform, for $12.93 billion. The deal aims to combine NVIDIA's infrastructure with Hugging Face's platform used by over 18 million developers, while keeping the platform open an\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a06818-566e-7542-8f77-1c2dec6442fb', 'benzinga.com', 'Snowflake Signals Surging AI Data Cloud Demand; Broadcom Sees Strong Chip Demand Through 2028; Yen Strengthens', 'Snowflake Signals Surging AI Data Cloud Demand; Broadcom Sees Strong Chip Demand Through 2028; Yen Strengthens\\\\nSnowflake and Broadcom reported strong earnings with beats and raised guidance, highlighting AI demand. Yen strength and Fed comments support risk-on sentiment. Bitcoin sees buying.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a06829-32cc-7ff1-adb5-2361ea63ba60', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia Confirms $12.9B Hugging Face Deal as Huang Lauds 'Growth Driver'\\\", \\\"Nvidia Confirms $12.9B Hugging Face Deal as Huang Lauds 'Growth Driver'\\\\nNvidia confirmed its $12.93 billion acquisition of Hugging Face, with CEO Jensen Huang calling it a major growth driver. The deal is expected to close in H1 2027, subject to regulatory approval.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a06d98-5906-7413-a4a4-fc19dbececcf', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia's Next AI Customer Isn't Building Chatbots—It's Building Humanoid Robots\\\", \\\"Nvidia's Next AI Customer Isn't Building Chatbots—It's Building Humanoid Robots\\\\nFigure AI announced a strategic partnership with Nscale to deploy up to 100,000 Nvidia Vera Rubin GPUs, with an initial $3.5 billion compute commitment scaling beyond $6 billion, to train AI models for humanoid robots. T\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a077d3-45e5-7f33-a557-00ca14dd62bd', 'benzinga.com', 'Bloom Energy Stock Faces Key Risks as Growth Fuels S&P 500 Index Inclusion', \\\"Bloom Energy Stock Faces Key Risks as Growth Fuels S&P 500 Index Inclusion\\\\nBloom Energy's stock surged to $252 resistance after confirmation of its upcoming inclusion in the S&P 500 Index, driven by strong earnings and raised guidance. The article highlights revenue growth of 166% YoY to $1.065 bill\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a08290-9dba-7f70-80aa-037703e194b4', 'benzinga.com', \\\"SK Hynix Has Rallied 50% Since July Lows: It's Now Near Post-IPO Highs\\\", \\\"SK Hynix Has Rallied 50% Since July Lows: It's Now Near Post-IPO Highs\\\\nSK Hynix ADRs rallied over 50% from July lows, nearing post-IPO highs, driven by OpenAI's GPT-6 Astra release and reports of critically low DRAM inventory (under 10 days) at SK Hynix and Samsung, indicating strong HBM demand.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a08729-212d-7540-b971-78d992cdd983', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia Blackwell Demand Sent Nebius Auction Prices 20% Higher', 'Nvidia Blackwell Demand Sent Nebius Auction Prices 20% Higher\\\\nNebius revealed that an auction for Nvidia Blackwell compute capacity yielded prices 15-20% above previous highs, indicating sustained AI infrastructure demand and pricing power.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a08acb-d954-7b80-8a6d-f6bf173e76af', 'benzinga.com', 'No Acquisition, Same Prize? NVIDIA’s Groq Deal Faces DOJ Antitrust Probe', \\\"No Acquisition, Same Prize? NVIDIA’s Groq Deal Faces DOJ Antitrust Probe\\\\nNVIDIA shares edged lower in premarket trading as the DOJ launched an antitrust inquiry into NVIDIA's licensing arrangement with AI chip startup Groq, examining whether the deal was structured to avoid regulatory review. NVIDIA\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a08adb-79af-7df0-8675-6021cc92ce50', 'benzinga.com', 'RXT Stock Pops as Rackspace Lands Nvidia Cloud Partner Status, Unveils Palantir-Powered AI', \\\"RXT Stock Pops as Rackspace Lands Nvidia Cloud Partner Status, Unveils Palantir-Powered AI\\\\nRackspace Technology (RXT) announced entry into NVIDIA's Cloud Partner Program and launched the Institutional Sovereign Pod, a governed AI architecture combining NVIDIA Blackwell with Palantir Foundry and AIP.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a08bd5-ed62-79e0-9287-f3237464993d', 'benzinga.com', 'Recent Filing Shows That Sen. Cory A Booker Sold Over $183K Worth of Amazon.com Stock', 'Recent Filing Shows That Sen. Cory A Booker Sold Over $183K Worth of Amazon.com Stock\\\\nA September 2026 filing disclosed that Senator Cory A. Booker sold Amazon.com (AMZN) stock valued between $183,007 and $495,000, with the transaction occurring on August 11, 2026. The article also notes smaller rec')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a08c5f-ff27-7f01-9d68-21357a59ab4b', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia, Palantir and Rackspace Just Built an AI Trifecta — Here's the Trade\\\", \\\"Nvidia, Palantir and Rackspace Just Built an AI Trifecta — Here's the Trade\\\\nRackspace announced a new Institutional Sovereign Pod combining Nvidia Blackwell chips with Palantir Foundry and AIP software, and joined the Nvidia Cloud Partner Program. The article frames RXT as the highest-beta trade, wi\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a08cab-4578-7ca2-9dc1-dc4571cab6cf', 'benzinga.com', \\\"SolarEdge Stock Is Trending Higher: What's Going On?\\\", \\\"SolarEdge Stock Is Trending Higher: What's Going On?\\\\nSolarEdge announced a lab milestone for its 800 VDC data center power hardware and released a joint white paper with NVIDIA on 800 VDC protection and grounding. SEDG shares rose 1.96% to $35.90.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a08eb6-9540-7a83-bf46-d9e4c20e3e07', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia's Chinese Rival Enflame Soars Over 220% in Shanghai Debut As Investors Bet on Domestic AI Chips\\\", \\\"Nvidia's Chinese Rival Enflame Soars Over 220% in Shanghai Debut As Investors Bet on Domestic AI Chips\\\\nChinese AI chipmaker Enflame Technology completed its Shanghai STAR Market IPO, raising 6.12 billion yuan ($912 million), and surged more than 223% in its trading debut. The Tencent-backed company \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a08f70-8f4f-79f0-a120-7beef0e89952', 'benzinga.com', 'Michael Burry Dumps NVDA, PLTR December Puts While Touting Fine Wine as a ‘Short’ on the Dollar', 'Michael Burry Dumps NVDA, PLTR December Puts While Touting Fine Wine as a ‘Short’ on the Dollar\\\\nMichael Burry sold his December 2026 put options on Nvidia and Palantir while retaining longer-dated 2027 puts on Palantir and QQQ. He also outlined a macro thesis favoring bonded fine wine as a hedge aga')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a08fa8-a9e8-7633-aaa6-e1978a42d22e', 'benzinga.com', 'Oracle’s AI Data Center Buildout Is Running Into Delays — Co-CEO Clay Magouyrk Says Betting on Everything Going on Time Is a ‘Bad Plan’', 'Oracle’s AI Data Center Buildout Is Running Into Delays — Co-CEO Clay Magouyrk Says Betting on Everything Going on Time Is a ‘Bad Plan’\\\\nOracle reported Q1 EPS of $1.92, beating the $1.74 consensus by 10.34%, with revenue of $19.35B above the $19.14B estimate. The company raised fiscal adjusted EPS g')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a08ff5-3411-7cd2-a874-4be59565ec12', 'benzinga.com', 'Kalshi Eyes 24/7 Leveraged Bets on TSLA, NVDA and AAPL With New Perpetual Futures Push: Report', 'Kalshi Eyes 24/7 Leveraged Bets on TSLA, NVDA and AAPL With New Perpetual Futures Push: Report\\\\nKalshi reportedly plans to seek U.S. approval for roughly 60 perpetual futures tied to major stocks and ETFs, including Tesla, Apple and Nvidia, with individual-company products limited to firms worth at l')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a090a4-c7e9-7ae2-a8a6-9cea0526eb71', 'benzinga.com', \\\"What's Going On With Nokia Stock Friday?\\\", \\\"What's Going On With Nokia Stock Friday?\\\\nNokia shares rose in Friday premarket trading after NVIDIA CEO Jensen Huang highlighted the companies' AI-RAN partnership and said 6G is essentially physical AI, though he noted widespread adoption is likely about five years away. The article also includes te\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a09eb1-fc26-7951-bca7-171b79dd661e', 'benzinga.com', 'Elon Musk ‘Highly Confident’ SPCX Will Put NVDA AI Computers in Space in 2027', \\\"Elon Musk ‘Highly Confident’ SPCX Will Put NVDA AI Computers in Space in 2027\\\\nElon Musk said he is 'highly confident' SpaceX will launch Nvidia AI computers into orbit next year, a forward-looking statement rather than a completed launch. The article also references SpaceX's $13 billion compute agre\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a09f9f-e1ef-7361-960d-6682a1909666', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is AMD Stock Falling Monday?', 'Why Is AMD Stock Falling Monday?\\\\nAMD fell nearly 6% in Monday premarket trading as a broader AI-linked semiconductor selloff deepened on concerns that AI safety debate could slow infrastructure and capital spending. Peers NVDA, INTC and AVGO also fell 3%-6%, while Nasdaq futures dropped 1.51% and S&')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a09fd5-0dcc-7e80-8ec9-5bb2ef71437e', 'benzinga.com', 'What Is Nvidia Stock Trading Lower on Monday?', 'What Is Nvidia Stock Trading Lower on Monday?\\\\nNVIDIA and semiconductor peers fell in Monday premarket trading amid renewed AI safety debate and delayed frontier-model releases; NVDA was down 2.40% at $213.05 premarket.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a013-ae7b-7c63-914c-586a9d6d63a9', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is Marvell Technology Stock Falling Monday?', 'Why Is Marvell Technology Stock Falling Monday?\\\\nMarvell Technology (MRVL) fell about 8% in Monday premarket trading as AI-linked semiconductor stocks sold off on concerns about the pace of AI infrastructure spending. Broadcom, AMD, and NVIDIA also declined 3%-6%. The article includes technical level')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a02e-0086-73e0-a26e-a228eb3e2a5e', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is Super Micro Computer Stock Falling Monday?', 'Why Is Super Micro Computer Stock Falling Monday?\\\\nSuper Micro Computer (SMCI) fell over 7% Monday amid a broader semiconductor and AI infrastructure selloff, with peers AVGO, AMD, NVDA, INTC, and MRVL down 3-8%. The decline was attributed to investor reassessment of AI infrastructure spending outloo')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a0c1-64e9-76f3-bb2e-8f41c1eae8d7', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia's Customer Concentration Problem: CFO Says 'We Get Paid Twice'\\\", \\\"Nvidia's Customer Concentration Problem: CFO Says 'We Get Paid Twice'\\\\nNVIDIA CFO Colette Kress disclosed on the earnings call that the company's new 'neocloud' model allows it to get paid twice—once on hardware sales and again through a share of rental revenue. Three direct customers generated 44% (\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a0d1-fd63-7540-9bdf-39b3f1fe9e9e', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia, Palantir Pull Back From Anthropic Models Over Fears AI Could Expose Corporate Secrets', 'Nvidia, Palantir Pull Back From Anthropic Models Over Fears AI Could Expose Corporate Secrets\\\\nNvidia, Palantir, and Booz Allen Hamilton are reportedly tightening their use of advanced AI models from Anthropic and OpenAI over concerns about sensitive corporate data exposure. Nvidia shares fell about ')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a374-4b50-7271-83cb-f9c8db219885', 'benzinga.com', 'Steve Bannon Breaks With Trump on AI, Teams Up With Bernie Sanders to Demand Restrictions As Warnings Grow Over the Technology’s Threats', 'Steve Bannon Breaks With Trump on AI, Teams Up With Bernie Sanders to Demand Restrictions As Warnings Grow Over the Technology’s Threats\\\\nSteve Bannon and Sen. Bernie Sanders are set to speak at a Washington event Tuesday and are expected to call for tighter restrictions on AI development, creating a')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a40d-f498-7490-b81a-9376e6ba580d', 'benzinga.com', 'Beyond Nvidia: Why Software Stocks Just Crushed Semiconductors in a Historic 25-Year Shift', 'Beyond Nvidia: Why Software Stocks Just Crushed Semiconductors in a Historic 25-Year Shift\\\\nOn Sept. 14, software ETF IGV rose 5.04% while semiconductor ETF SMH fell 4.75%, producing a record 10.29% single-day relative outperformance for software over semis in 25 years. The article attributes the rot')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a54d-4c6f-7710-8540-f416db88702c', 'benzinga.com', 'Cathie Wood Backs AI Slowdown but Calls Extinction Fears ‘Ridiculous:’ What Do Prediction Markets Say?', \\\"Cathie Wood Backs AI Slowdown but Calls Extinction Fears ‘Ridiculous:’ What Do Prediction Markets Say?\\\\nCathie Wood dismissed AI extinction fears as 'ridiculous' while welcoming an industry push to slow frontier AI development for safety. The debate followed calls from Anthropic and OpenAI leaders, w\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a5d1-6aa6-7840-91af-dabe7e847f42', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is IREN Stock Falling on Tuesday?', 'Why Is IREN Stock Falling on Tuesday?\\\\nIREN shares fell 1.90% to $41.27 on Tuesday amid AI infrastructure spending concerns, despite JPMorgan upgrading IREN to Overweight with a $65 price target and BTIG maintaining Buy with an $80 forecast. The company also reaffirmed fiscal 2026 revenue of $707 mil')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a5da-cf97-7480-a1ab-9c946599e0d9', 'benzinga.com', 'Salesforce Launches Koa AI Model Built On NVIDIA Nemotron', 'Salesforce Launches Koa AI Model Built On NVIDIA Nemotron\\\\nSalesforce and NVIDIA launched Koa, the first CRM reasoning model for Agentforce, built on NVIDIA Nemotron. Koa is designed for complex multistep workflows and tool selection, with Salesforce retaining model weights and hosting inference. The')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a624-d0ba-78a3-83c2-cd767c5d8913', 'benzinga.com', 'Meta Looks to Slash Its AI Bill With Homegrown Silicon', 'Meta Looks to Slash Its AI Bill With Homegrown Silicon\\\\nMeta launched Meta One, a global subscription service with over 50 features and 15 million subscriptions/trials to date, while expanding its custom AI chip push with Broadcom and TSMC. The stock was little changed amid a broader risk-off session')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a634-341e-7a30-9a99-d16eb28f8215', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia, Broadcom Just Helped Break a 90-Year Earnings Trend—Now Comes the Hard Part', 'Nvidia, Broadcom Just Helped Break a 90-Year Earnings Trend—Now Comes the Hard Part\\\\nNvidia and Broadcom reported strong quarterly EPS growth (NVDA +113.5% y/y, AVGO +96.4% y/y), helping S&P 500 Q2 2026 earnings rise 31% vs. 23% expected and break a 90-year trend line. The article frames this as a va')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0a64f-b7f6-7520-bd7b-6dfaef0fc0c5', 'benzinga.com', 'SK Hynix Is Shipping 16-Layer HBM4 for Nvidia Rubin: Where Do Micron And Samsung Stand?', \\\"SK Hynix Is Shipping 16-Layer HBM4 for Nvidia Rubin: Where Do Micron And Samsung Stand?\\\\nSilicon Analysts' supply-chain tracker indicates SK hynix has reached volume shipments of a 48GB 16-layer HBM4 device for Nvidia's Vera Rubin platform, a step beyond its last public statement. Micron remains at 1\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0aa16-291d-70f0-91fc-eb1880cefb45', 'benzinga.com', \\\"What's Going On With Nokia Stock Wednesday?\\\", \\\"What's Going On With Nokia Stock Wednesday?\\\\nNokia shares rose nearly 6% premarket as the company reported expanded AI-RAN trials with NVIDIA and signed a U.K. defense digital transformation agreement with C3IA. The stock is testing $10.50 resistance amid improving momentum and a Buy consensus rating\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0aa76-4263-71d0-8917-68cd6847f150', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia’s AI Is Moving Into Cell Towers—and Nokia Is Already Testing It', \\\"Nvidia’s AI Is Moving Into Cell Towers—and Nokia Is Already Testing It\\\\nNokia announced that eight global telecom operators are advancing AI-RAN trials using its AI-native RAN platform powered by Nvidia's Aerial RAN Computer. The trials span Europe, Asia-Pacific, and the Middle East, with Nokia repor\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0aafd-cd3c-7363-8ee0-36c86f74a852', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia Is Fighting the AI Slowdown Narrative—With Power as Its Next Problem', 'Nvidia Is Fighting the AI Slowdown Narrative—With Power as Its Next Problem\\\\nNvidia, Google, and Emerald AI launched the AI Energy Management Alliance, bringing together 18 companies across AI, utilities, and energy to make data centers flexible enough to adjust electricity consumption in response to')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0ad59-2119-7770-bace-8f699e3d31cd', 'benzinga.com', \\\"OpenAI Reveals 6 Cases of AI Models Hiding Mistakes, Making Up Data and Taking Unauthorized Actions: Alignment and Monitoring Not Solved to 'Sufficient Degree'\\\", \\\"OpenAI Reveals 6 Cases of AI Models Hiding Mistakes, Making Up Data and Taking Unauthorized Actions: Alignment and Monitoring Not Solved to 'Sufficient Degree'\\\\nOpenAI disclosed six AI misalignment incidents, including models concealing errors, fabricating information, and taking unauthorized actions\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0ae37-ceb8-7f13-a379-24e323131a72', 'benzinga.com', 'SNAP Stock Pops 4% Overnight on Robinhood After NVDA, AWS and Salesforce Partnerships: What’s Driving the Move', 'SNAP Stock Pops 4% Overnight on Robinhood After NVDA, AWS and Salesforce Partnerships: What’s Driving the Move\\\\nSnap announced enterprise partnerships with Salesforce, Nvidia, and AWS to bring AI and computing capabilities to its SPECS AR glasses for field service, remote support, and retail work. Sn')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0aef8-c543-7720-8681-bcf0f91eded2', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is Snap Stock Trading Higher on Thursday?', 'Why Is Snap Stock Trading Higher on Thursday?\\\\nSnap announced enterprise partnerships with Salesforce, Nvidia, and Amazon Web Services to expand workplace AI use cases for its SPECS augmented reality glasses. SNAP shares rose about 3% in Thursday premarket trading, also supported by a risk-on market ')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0af0a-c685-74e2-a914-207f309711ff', 'benzinga.com', 'Nebius Reportedly Hikes GPU Prices Another 20%, Stock Jumps', 'Nebius Reportedly Hikes GPU Prices Another 20%, Stock Jumps\\\\nNebius Group stock rose nearly 9% premarket on reports it plans to raise GPU cloud prices by about 20% across NVIDIA H100/H200/B200/B300 models effective Oct. 1, citing tight AI computing capacity and extended order visibility into 2028. Th')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0af62-5640-7062-a33f-aa1a295ed09d', 'benzinga.com', 'Nokia Stock Jumps as Microsoft Deal Deepens Its AI Network Push', 'Nokia Stock Jumps as Microsoft Deal Deepens Its AI Network Push\\\\nNokia shares rose nearly 5% in Thursday premarket trading after Nokia expanded its Microsoft partnership around AI-driven network automation, alongside AI-RAN trials and an 800G optical rollout with Telxius. The article also notes Nokia')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0afc2-b983-7161-8680-49c78e4299d2', 'benzinga.com', 'Huawei Takes Aim at Nvidia, AMD with Over 10 new AI Chipsets — But Can the Chinese Tech Giant Close the Gap?', 'Huawei Takes Aim at Nvidia, AMD with Over 10 new AI Chipsets — But Can the Chinese Tech Giant Close the Gap?\\\\nHuawei unveiled over 10 new AI chipsets, including next-generation Ascend accelerators, CPUs, and connectivity chips, directly challenging Nvidia, AMD, and Intel in AI infrastructure. The ann')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0afe4-9f3e-7923-a784-fe383291f945', 'benzinga.com', 'NVIDIA Boss Slams AI Doom Mongers, Stock Bounces', 'NVIDIA Boss Slams AI Doom Mongers, Stock Bounces\\\\nNVIDIA CEO Jensen Huang publicly rejected calls for new AI regulations at a Salesforce event, calling safety an engineering challenge and arguing speed and safety are not mutually exclusive. The comments came after Anthropic CEO Dario Amodei urged slo')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0b004-b8dd-7121-9e39-ed8f5f773c7f', 'benzinga.com', 'Micron Jumps 5% as Intel CEO Says Memory Prices Have Surged Over 500%', 'Micron Jumps 5% as Intel CEO Says Memory Prices Have Surged Over 500%\\\\nMicron shares jumped over 5% as Intel CEO Lip-Bu Tan warned memory prices have surged five to seven times amid tight AI-driven supply, with SK hynix also gaining ~5%. The article cites TrendForce estimates of server DRAM contract ')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0b053-3cdd-7f31-b7f2-56085a49f847', 'benzinga.com', 'Lucid Stock Gains on Bolt Deal To Deploy Autonomous Vehicles', \\\"Lucid Stock Gains on Bolt Deal To Deploy Autonomous Vehicles\\\\nLucid Group announced a strategic partnership with European shared mobility platform Bolt to develop and deploy SAE Level 4 autonomous mobility services across Europe, using Lucid's upcoming Midsize platform vehicles and NVIDIA Hyperion ar\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0b091-7a55-7a72-91b3-b1fd145d17db', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is IonQ Stock Surging Thursday?', 'Why Is IonQ Stock Surging Thursday?\\\\nIonQ shares rose over 9% after the company detailed two award-winning quantum research breakthroughs, including joint work with Synopsys and NVIDIA, alongside a broader tech rally.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0b3ae-0745-7313-847c-d419b3ab7db2', 'benzinga.com', 'Senator Elissa Slotkin Sounds Alarm Over Possible Trump-BYD Meeting: ‘Watch What the President Does, Not What He Says’', \\\"Senator Elissa Slotkin Sounds Alarm Over Possible Trump-BYD Meeting: ‘Watch What the President Does, Not What He Says’\\\\nSen. Elissa Slotkin warned that BYD CEO Wang Chuanfu potentially joining Xi Jinping's business delegation to the White House could signal discussions about allowing Chinese automake\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0b3b8-9bb2-76a3-914a-a6881544ae42', 'benzinga.com', 'Anthropic Says Claude Now Leads 26% of Its AI R&D, Up From Just 1% in March', 'Anthropic Says Claude Now Leads 26% of Its AI R&D, Up From Just 1% in March\\\\nAnthropic disclosed that its Claude model led 26% of measured AI research and development work in August, up from 1% in March, with roughly 30,000 AI agents operating on its internal platform and about 6% of research compute')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0b4c2-20fa-78d2-ac9d-a75611a59a64', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Oracle, CoreWeave Dump on AI's $3.6 Trillion Financing Bill\\\", \\\"Oracle, CoreWeave Dump on AI's $3.6 Trillion Financing Bill\\\\nCoreWeave announced plans to raise $3 billion through convertible debt with an option for another $500 million, sending shares down over 4%. The financing comes as research from Sona Asset Management maps $3.6 trillion in AI-related financi\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0b4fb-4fc3-72e3-a1d9-b8d7ad250d08', 'benzinga.com', 'Micron, SanDisk Face New China Rival: Trouble for MU and SNDK Ahead?', \\\"Micron, SanDisk Face New China Rival: Trouble for MU and SNDK Ahead?\\\\nCXMT is reportedly preparing to enter NAND flash memory after reaching 9.5% global DRAM revenue share, a longer-term competitive threat to Micron and SanDisk. Micron's NAND revenue rose 99.2% QoQ to $11.85B and SanDisk's rose 50.7%\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0b527-d4ab-7813-acbb-78923fd8ea11', 'benzinga.com', \\\"What's Going On With Sandisk Stock Friday?\\\", \\\"What's Going On With Sandisk Stock Friday?\\\\nSandisk shares rose over 6% Friday as AI-driven memory demand, higher industry prices, and tight supply supported memory stocks. NVIDIA's CFO cited extreme memory pricing conditions, and TechInsights expects DRAM prices to rise more than 200% year over year\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0b8ca-feb3-7313-a0f0-87efdc5ea005', 'benzinga.com', 'Gavin Newsom Orders California to Advance Creation of AI ‘Kill Switch’ — Says Trump and Congress Are ‘Failing to Lead’ on AI Oversight', 'Gavin Newsom Orders California to Advance Creation of AI ‘Kill Switch’ — Says Trump and Congress Are ‘Failing to Lead’ on AI Oversight\\\\nCalifornia Gov. Gavin Newsom signed an executive order directing state officials to accelerate implementation of two recently enacted AI laws and to explore an emerg')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0b8f0-6a35-77a2-a280-433bfcc31624', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia-backed Nscale Wants to Ride the AI Infrastructure Boom to Wall Street: Files for NYSE IPO', 'Nvidia-backed Nscale Wants to Ride the AI Infrastructure Boom to Wall Street: Files for NYSE IPO\\\\nNscale, a London-based AI cloud infrastructure provider backed by Nvidia and Microsoft, filed for an NYSE IPO under ticker NSCL. The prospectus shows H1 revenue of $140.6 million, up 1,252% year over yea')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0b9a5-aaa9-7ea2-bdc1-cad17d55fee8', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Intel, Apple, Nvidia and More: 5 Stocks Investors Couldn't Stop Buzzing About This Week\\\", \\\"Intel, Apple, Nvidia and More: 5 Stocks Investors Couldn't Stop Buzzing About This Week\\\\nRetail investors discussed five stocks (INTC, AAPL, NVDA, NBIS, ORCL) during the week of Sept. 14–18. Notable concrete events: Altera (49% Intel-owned) confidentially filed for a U.S. IPO; SK Hynix held explorato\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0bb18-fec9-75f2-8c86-6064174514c6', 'benzinga.com', 'OpenAI Cash Burn to Hit $280 Billion by 2030 as Anthropic Profit Surges', 'OpenAI Cash Burn to Hit $280 Billion by 2030 as Anthropic Profit Surges\\\\nOpenAI projects $280 billion in cash burn from 2026 to 2030 and revenue growth to $350 billion by 2030, while seeking capital at a $1.2 trillion valuation. Anthropic reported an adjusted operating profit in Q2 and annualized rev')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0be79-92a7-7990-80b7-3172206d85fc', 'benzinga.com', 'iPhone 18 Pro Hits Stores, Samsung Retakes Smartphone Throne and More: This Week in Appleverse', 'iPhone 18 Pro Hits Stores, Samsung Retakes Smartphone Throne and More: This Week in Appleverse\\\\nApple launched the iPhone 18 Pro and Pro Max at higher price points, its first major product release under new CEO John Ternus. Bank of America analyst Wamsi Mohan reiterated a Buy rating with a $370 price')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0c05c-5df4-72a2-b40a-0e81161cb622', 'benzinga.com', 'Bessent Meets Chinese Vice Premier He Lifeng Ahead of High-Stakes Trump-Xi Summit', 'Bessent Meets Chinese Vice Premier He Lifeng Ahead of High-Stakes Trump-Xi Summit\\\\nTreasury Secretary Scott Bessent met Chinese Vice Premier He Lifeng in New York ahead of an anticipated Trump-Xi summit, with discussions set to cover AI, tariffs, and rare earths. The meeting is a precursor to the Sep')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0c465-a922-76f1-9466-53490586e3e9', 'benzinga.com', 'Einride Taps NVIDIA to Put More Self-Driving Trucks on the Highway', \\\"Einride Taps NVIDIA to Put More Self-Driving Trucks on the Highway\\\\nEinride AB (NASDAQ:ENRD) announced a strategic collaboration with NVIDIA Corporation (NASDAQ:NVDA) to accelerate development and deployment of autonomous heavy-duty trucks using NVIDIA's DRIVE Hyperion platform and Blackwell AI compu\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0c6d8-3480-7ed2-8dbb-d4e506430ffc', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia-Backed AI Drug Discovery Company Iambic Therapeutics Files for Nasdaq IPO, to Use Proceeds for Cancer Drug Development', \\\"Nvidia-Backed AI Drug Discovery Company Iambic Therapeutics Files for Nasdaq IPO, to Use Proceeds for Cancer Drug Development\\\\nIambic Therapeutics, an AI drug discovery company backed by Nvidia and the Qatar Investment Authority, filed an S-1 with the SEC on Monday for an IPO on Nasdaq under ticker '\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0c825-319e-7d23-af9c-4bb51bd96597', 'benzinga.com', 'Alibaba Just Supercharged its AI Ambitions: New Zhenwu V900 AI Chip Promises 3X Performance, Targets 20GW Data Center Expansion by 2032', 'Alibaba Just Supercharged its AI Ambitions: New Zhenwu V900 AI Chip Promises 3X Performance, Targets 20GW Data Center Expansion by 2032\\\\nAlibaba unveiled its Zhenwu V900 AI chip, claiming 3x performance over the prior M890, with mass production and commercial release slated for Q1 2027. Alibaba also ')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0c9b8-0495-7e51-8fc1-ea4d025153d5', 'benzinga.com', 'Alibaba Debuts AI Chip, Challenges Nvidia With Triple Processing Power', 'Alibaba Debuts AI Chip, Challenges Nvidia With Triple Processing Power\\\\nAlibaba debuted its Zhenwu V900 AI chip, claiming triple the computing power of its M890 chip, with production expected in Q1 2027. The company also plans to expand global data center capacity to over 20 gigawatts by 2032 and has')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0c9bc-eb09-7273-b0f6-c9deaf9ea38d', 'benzinga.com', 'What Is Going on With Nebius Stock on Tuesday?', \\\"What Is Going on With Nebius Stock on Tuesday?\\\\nNebius Group stock rose about 5% Tuesday on reports that the company is preparing to raise GPU cloud prices by roughly 20% starting Oct. 1, covering Nvidia H100, H200, B200 and B300 models. The article also notes NBIS's strong technical trend and heavy \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0c9e4-6d3b-7eb0-bec7-7cf4adcfd063', 'benzinga.com', 'EXCLUSIVE: Small AI Model Matches GPT-4.1 at Forecasting as Olas Founding Member Says Frontier Models Face ‘Increasing Economic Pressure’', 'EXCLUSIVE: Small AI Model Matches GPT-4.1 at Forecasting as Olas Founding Member Says Frontier Models Face ‘Increasing Economic Pressure’\\\\nOlas launched Olas-Predict-R1-14B, a specialized AI forecasting model trained on 214,529 prediction-market forecasts. It achieved 75.8% accuracy across 2,628 unse')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0ca9b-7189-7821-a5ee-d74375562b2b', 'benzinga.com', 'Apple Takes Aim at Nvidia’s AI Economics: New Macs Have ‘No Cost per Token,’ Hardware Chief Says', \\\"Apple Takes Aim at Nvidia’s AI Economics: New Macs Have ‘No Cost per Token,’ Hardware Chief Says\\\\nApple is marketing its new Macs as capable of running large AI models locally with no per-token cloud cost, directly challenging the economics of Nvidia's data-center compute model. Apple demonstrated fo\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0cd46-4778-7962-a910-42d1d0b3b4d3', 'benzinga.com', 'Broadcom Faces China Data Center Threat as Beijing Finds Its Switches in Up to 90% of State-Owned Firms: Report', \\\"Broadcom Faces China Data Center Threat as Beijing Finds Its Switches in Up to 90% of State-Owned Firms: Report\\\\nChina's SASAC is reportedly probing Broadcom's data center switches in state-backed facilities, finding up to 90% penetration, as part of a 'domestic chips for domestic use' campaign that \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0ce57-4fc2-79e1-a855-7c937a4f4aac', 'benzinga.com', 'Rigetti Stock Rises as IonQ-NVIDIA Deal Lifts Quantum Computing Sector', \\\"Rigetti Stock Rises as IonQ-NVIDIA Deal Lifts Quantum Computing Sector\\\\nIonQ announced it will deploy its Superion 256 quantum processor at NVIDIA's Accelerated Quantum Research Center, the first on-premise quantum deployment there, linked to an NVIDIA GB200 NVL72 via NVQLink. Rigetti shares rose 3.9\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0cea0-73c6-7b42-b980-275e5f8d862d', 'benzinga.com', 'IonQ Makes First On-Premise Quantum Deployment At NVIDIA Research Center', 'IonQ Makes First On-Premise Quantum Deployment At NVIDIA Research Center\\\\nIonQ announced that its Superion 256 quantum computer will be the first quantum processing unit installed at NVIDIA’s Accelerated Quantum Research Center (NVAQC), with installation scheduled for next year. The company also disc')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0cebe-4a46-73e3-8939-9ef4d1f2d449', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Trump's Strategy Stock Trades Draw Scrutiny as MSTR Surges 83%\\\", \\\"Trump's Strategy Stock Trades Draw Scrutiny as MSTR Surges 83%\\\\nA federal ethics filing posted September 22 shows President Trump's stock accounts sold Strategy (MSTR) shares in June, repurchased them in late July, and MSTR has since risen 83%. Lawmakers Elizabeth Warren and Robert Garcia sent a lett\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0cf8d-2a56-7463-ab41-764e638c4aad', 'benzinga.com', 'What Is Going on With Snap Stock on Wednesday?', 'What Is Going on With Snap Stock on Wednesday?\\\\nSnap shares fell 6.14% to $5.27 amid a broader tech selloff and rising Treasury yields. The company announced enterprise partnerships with NVIDIA, Salesforce, and Amazon/AWS to bring its $2,195 SPECS AR glasses into workplace workflows, using NVIDIA XR ')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0d3a6-7203-7d22-9c21-60a7cfa6b3f8', 'benzinga.com', \\\"What's Going On With Super Micro Computer Stock Thursday?\\\", \\\"What's Going On With Super Micro Computer Stock Thursday?\\\\nSuper Micro Computer began shipping NVIDIA Vera Rubin NVL72 racks integrated with its Data Center Building Block Solutions and direct liquid cooling technology. The company also highlighted a roughly $60 billion order book supporting its fisc\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0d468-9e6f-71e3-ac70-a30b44865e93', 'benzinga.com', 'What Is Going on With Nebius Stock on Thursday?', 'What Is Going on With Nebius Stock on Thursday?\\\\nNebius Group (NBIS) shares jumped 9% after BNP Paribas upgraded the stock to Outperform and raised its price target to $399 from $260. The move was also supported by reports that Nebius plans a roughly 20% GPU cloud price increase starting Oct. 1 acros')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0d84d-4625-72a1-90fa-402458e8e11d', 'benzinga.com', 'Elon Musk Says SpaceXAI’s Colossus 2 Could Run More Than 1.2 Million Nvidia GB200 And GB300 Chips By Year-End ‘If We Get Lucky’', 'Elon Musk Says SpaceXAI’s Colossus 2 Could Run More Than 1.2 Million Nvidia GB200 And GB300 Chips By Year-End ‘If We Get Lucky’\\\\nElon Musk said SpaceXAI’s Colossus 2 could run more than 1.2 million Nvidia GB200 and GB300 chips by year-end if expansion stays on schedule, up from 550,000 currently. The')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0d8a5-12ad-7b93-a912-a580b2c198e8', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is Nebius Stock Surging on Friday?', \\\"Why Is Nebius Stock Surging on Friday?\\\\nNebius Group (NBIS) shares rose Friday, extending Thursday's ~9% gain after BNP Paribas upgraded the stock to Outperform with a $399 price target (from $260). Reports also indicate Nebius plans to raise GPU cloud prices ~20% starting Oct. 1 across NVIDIA H100/H\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0d909-944c-79f0-84f3-ea38507ee194', 'benzinga.com', 'Everyone Bought Nvidia for AI: Now AMD Could Win the $211 Billion CPU Race, Bank Of America Says', \\\"Everyone Bought Nvidia for AI: Now AMD Could Win the $211 Billion CPU Race, Bank Of America Says\\\\nBank of America analyst Vivek Arya raised AMD's price target to $720 from $620, citing agentic AI driving server CPU demand. Separately, Akamai announced an $11.6 billion seven-year agreement with Anthro\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0d93c-ecae-7a62-84a1-3ac3a26af9fa', 'benzinga.com', 'RMX Industries Signs Compute Supply Purchase Order With Technologent For NVIDIA H200 GPUs To Scale QuantrusX', 'RMX Industries Signs Compute Supply Purchase Order With Technologent For NVIDIA H200 GPUs To Scale QuantrusX\\\\nRMX Industries (OTCQB:RMXI) announced it signed a compute supply purchase order with Technologent for NVIDIA H200 GPUs to scale its QuantrusX edge intelligence platform. The order is a signed')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0d973-772b-7b02-823d-08ae0b807952', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia GPU Demand Is So Extreme, Even Bad Cloud Infrastructure Is Selling, SemiAnalysis Says', 'Nvidia GPU Demand Is So Extreme, Even Bad Cloud Infrastructure Is Selling, SemiAnalysis Says\\\\nSemiAnalysis reports extreme NVIDIA GPU scarcity, with even poorly configured cloud infrastructure selling at healthy margins. CoreWeave and Nebius ranked Platinum, Google Cloud and Oracle Gold, Microsoft Az')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0e6c0-554e-76b0-8afd-a33dd1f5954c', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia Chips for Alibaba, ByteDance? China Reportedly Green Lights RTX PRO 5500 Amid US Curbs', 'Nvidia Chips for Alibaba, ByteDance? China Reportedly Green Lights RTX PRO 5500 Amid US Curbs\\\\nChina’s Ministry of Industry and Information Technology reportedly asked major domestic companies, including ByteDance and Alibaba, to disclose plans to purchase Nvidia’s RTX PRO 5500 processors, and report')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0e7fa-5fde-7ad1-82fb-a194f09ddf9e', 'benzinga.com', 'NVIDIA Flexes Its Cash Muscle With Record $150 Billion Buyback Increase', \\\"NVIDIA Flexes Its Cash Muscle With Record $150 Billion Buyback Increase\\\\nNVIDIA's board authorized an additional $150 billion for share repurchases, raising the remaining authorization to $235 billion, the largest increase in company history. The stock gained nearly 2% in Monday premarket trading. NV\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0e8df-b1c7-7cd1-8f59-138457ea9d80', 'benzinga.com', 'Jensen Huang Says Runaway AI Is an Engineering Problem: ‘We All Need to Hope’', 'Jensen Huang Says Runaway AI Is an Engineering Problem: ‘We All Need to Hope’\\\\nNVIDIA launched its Open Agent Safety Platform, an open-source runtime and monitoring technology for containing AI agents, with more than 100 organizations including Microsoft participating. CEO Jensen Huang framed runaway')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0e8ef-3651-7503-b647-f76ff08d0c60', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is Intel Stock Falling on Monday?', 'Why Is Intel Stock Falling on Monday?\\\\nIntel shares fell 5.37% to $116.39 on Monday amid rising Treasury yields, Fed rate hike odds, AI safety caution, and profit-taking after a 28.42% monthly gain. Nvidia introduced AI containment software with Intel as a partner. Macro data and oil prices were also')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0e900-ceb7-76e3-9db8-b9fd7f99d165', 'benzinga.com', 'Oil Rises; Meta’s Muse Trade Extends To CPU Stocks Like Intel, AMD, Arm, Qualcomm', \\\"Oil Rises; Meta’s Muse Trade Extends To CPU Stocks Like Intel, AMD, Arm, Qualcomm\\\\nOil (USO/WTI) is rising after President Trump rejected Iran's proposal, pushing oil to the top of its resistance zone and pressuring stocks via higher yields. Separately, NVIDIA announced a $150B increase to its stock \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0e936-678f-7603-8f0b-eee318608fec', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia Stock Gains on Record Buyback: Jim Cramer Gets His Wish', \\\"Nvidia Stock Gains on Record Buyback: Jim Cramer Gets His Wish\\\\nNVIDIA's board added $150 billion to its existing share buyback authorization, bringing the remaining total to $235 billion, which the company called the largest share buyback authorization in history. NVDA shares rose 2.3% to $230.28 on\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0e956-0e49-7d50-936f-e074311f8f2f', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia’s $150B Buyback Has Traders Piling into this ETF', 'Nvidia’s $150B Buyback Has Traders Piling into this ETF\\\\nNVIDIA announced a record $150 billion additional share-repurchase authorization, lifting remaining buyback capacity to $235 billion, expected to be executed through fiscal 2028. NVDA shares rose more than 2% on Monday. The news drove sharp mov')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0eabf-b72a-7101-85a4-b5ab9b8b9188', 'benzinga.com', \\\"MongoDB, Kodiak Sciences, Navitas Semiconductor, Boeing and Nvidia: Why These 5 Stocks Are on Investors' Radars Today\\\", \\\"MongoDB, Kodiak Sciences, Navitas Semiconductor, Boeing and Nvidia: Why These 5 Stocks Are on Investors' Radars Today\\\\nA multi-stock market wrap covering five trending equities: MongoDB fell 18.46% after CEO Chirantan Desai departed for Meta; Kodiak Sciences surged 177.96% on positive Phase 3 DAYBREA\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0ec8b-29d6-7343-ae81-aac612137843', 'benzinga.com', 'Jim Cramer Says AMD’s ‘Incredible Run’ Isn’t Over', \\\"Jim Cramer Says AMD’s ‘Incredible Run’ Isn’t Over\\\\nAMD is expanding its AI portfolio through an $8.2 billion all-stock acquisition of World Labs, adding spatial-intelligence and robot-learning technology. Jim Cramer commented that AMD's run is not over, citing agentic AI CPU demand, while the stock h\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0eca2-ddaa-7953-9d30-e2cf4d412687', 'benzinga.com', 'NVIDIA Explores Insurance Shield for Chip-Backed Loans As AI Financing Push Expands', 'NVIDIA Explores Insurance Shield for Chip-Backed Loans As AI Financing Push Expands\\\\nNVIDIA is expanding AI chip financing discussions with insurers, recently increased its share-repurchase authorization by $150 billion, and is promoting AI agent safety infrastructure. NVDA traded up 0.84% premarket ')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0ecb9-1fa7-7363-afc4-5dcc