k. Is It Cheap Enough?', \\\"Nvidia Just Put $150 Billion Behind Its Stock. Is It Cheap Enough?\\\\nNVIDIA's board approved an additional $150 billion share repurchase authorization, bringing total remaining authorization to $235 billion through fiscal 2028. The article frames the buyback as a capital-allocation event and discusses\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0edd6-5430-7ba3-b78a-d2b912818453', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia Stock Buyback Impresses Market Experts: ‘Very Much Like This Move’', \\\"Nvidia Stock Buyback Impresses Market Experts: ‘Very Much Like This Move’\\\\nNVIDIA's board authorized a record $150 billion increase to its existing share buyback, bringing total remaining authorization to $235 billion, to be executed through fiscal 2028. Shares rose 0.79% to $230.67 on the news, and \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0ede9-862a-7012-9e10-b5b5b1adb1f7', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Oil Near $100 Should Lift Energy. Instead XLE ETF Is Falling — Here's Why\\\", \\\"Oil Near $100 Should Lift Energy. Instead XLE ETF Is Falling — Here's Why\\\\nEnergy ETF XLE fell 1.59% even as Brent crude traded above $100, while tech ETF XLK gained ~1%. The divergence is attributed to Brent's ~2% pullback on recovering Middle Eastern supply and profit-taking, plus XLE's heavy conce\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0ee04-4519-7ad2-8c47-0e686187b9e7', 'benzinga.com', \\\"What's Going On With Nebius Group Stock Tuesday?\\\", \\\"What's Going On With Nebius Group Stock Tuesday?\\\\nNebius Group (NBIS) shares rose ~4.4% Tuesday after the company reportedly raised GPU cloud prices by roughly 20% starting Oct. 1, covering NVIDIA H100, H200, B200, and B300 GPU models. The article also notes analyst upgrades and technical momentum.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a0eee9-7812-7290-bd73-ec5f80147a9c', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia Reverses After $150B Buyback News, But This NVDA-Tied ETF Is Still the Market’s Most Traded', 'Nvidia Reverses After $150B Buyback News, But This NVDA-Tied ETF Is Still th