ras Systems faces a scheduled lock-up expiry on Wednesday that will make up to 19.4 million additional shares eligible for sale, equal to roughly 8% of shares outstanding. The stock recently closed at a record low of $146.62 a')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a135fc-3d2a-7ba0-a7f6-7f2511cdd19e', 'benzinga.com', \\\"'Nvidia Acquires A Stake In Doctolib; No Terms Disclosed; Doctolib Was Valued At €3.6 Billion Last April. NVIDIA Will Not Sit On Doctolib's Board Of Directors' - Le Figaro\\\", \\\"'Nvidia Acquires A Stake In Doctolib; No Terms Disclosed; Doctolib Was Valued At €3.6 Billion Last April. NVIDIA Will Not Sit On Doctolib's Board Of Directors' - Le Figaro\\\\nNvidia has acquired a stake in French healthcare technology company Doctolib, with no financial terms disclosed. Doctolib was va\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a13a1c-3e1a-7c42-a25a-83560ea8b96d', 'benzinga.com', 'Danaher Brings NVIDIA AI Into Scientific Instruments in Push for Faster Discoveries', \\\"Danaher Brings NVIDIA AI Into Scientific Instruments in Push for Faster Discoveries\\\\nDanaher announced an AI collaboration with NVIDIA focused on autonomous science, combining Danaher's scientific instruments and lab software with NVIDIA's accelerated computing and AI capabilities. DHR shares rose 0.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a13a74-e2e9-7471-832e-7b520f3d0a9a', 'benzinga.com', \\\"CoreWeave Eyes 'Unlimited' Insurance Capital to Fuel AI Expansion as Debt Needs Grow, Co-Founder Says ‘You Have to Be Huge’\\\", \\\"CoreWeave Eyes 'Unlimited' Insurance Capital to Fuel AI Expansion as Debt Needs Grow, Co-Founder Says ‘You Have to Be Huge’\\\\nCoreWeave co-founder Brannin McBee said the company is pursuing insurance-industry capital and evaluating additional delayed-draw term loans to fund AI data-center expansion, a\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a13a86-5964-7233-be17-7ef5bf1ab98b', 'benzinga.com', 'Honeywell Technologies Rolls Out AI And Simulation Platform Forge Cognition Developed With Nvidia, Dell', 'Honeywell Technologies Rolls Out AI And Simulation Platform Forge Cognition Developed With Nvidia, Dell\\\\nHoneywell Technologies introduced Forge Cognition, a self-contained agentic AI and simulation platform for facility operations, developed with technology from NVIDIA and Dell Technologies.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a13b1e-0e9e-7ba0-bec4-19dc3bb0350b', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is Super Micro Computer Stock Falling on Wednesday?', 'Why Is Super Micro Computer Stock Falling on Wednesday?\\\\nSuper Micro Computer shares fell 5.38% to $36.97 on Wednesday as a contractor linked to the company pleaded guilty in a U.S. export-control case involving Nvidia AI servers allegedly diverted to China in a $2.5 billion scheme. Super Micro said ')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a13b63-7ab1-7202-825e-1ca5173cc842', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Michael Dell Warns Memory Shortage Could Be a 'Four-Year Problem'\\\", \\\"Michael Dell Warns Memory Shortage Could Be a 'Four-Year Problem'\\\\nDell CEO Michael Dell warned that memory and semiconductor supply constraints could persist for four years as AI demand outpaces manufacturing capacity, with new fabs not arriving until 2029-2030. Barclays downgraded Dell to Equal-Wei\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a13b86-ee99-7543-bbaa-d44f4ae249c8', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is Dell Technologies Stock Sinking Wednesday?', 'Why Is Dell Technologies Stock Sinking Wednesday?\\\\nDell Technologies shares fell 11.59% to $506.14 after Barclays downgraded DELL from Overweight to Equal-Weight and cut its price forecast to $574 from $603, citing stretched valuation and delayed AI-driven enterprise spending. CEO Michael Dell separa')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a13b89-c214-7360-99ad-097d73a40f61', 'benzinga.com', 'ASML Says AI Boom Is Boosting Pricing Power as Chipmakers Agree to Pay More', 'ASML Says AI Boom Is Boosting Pricing Power as Chipmakers Agree to Pay More\\\\nASML confirmed it concluded negotiations with customers for higher prices on its most critical chipmaking equipment, with revenue and margin benefits expected to begin in 2027 and fully arrive in 2028. The company cited AI-d')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a13fe4-3ba3-7b13-a40c-edde4ab03cdb', 'benzinga.com', 'Ericsson Plans Price Hikes As AI Boom Drives Up Equipment Costs', 'Ericsson Plans Price Hikes As AI Boom Drives Up Equipment Costs\\\\nEricsson reported third-quarter revenue of 59.5 billion kronor and earnings of 18 cents per share, beating estimates of $5.79 billion in revenue and 14 cents per share. Shares rose as much as 11% in Stockholm; management warned rising e')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a1401e-6f73-7333-8b7d-b98713013b0b', 'benzinga.com', 'Hyperliquid Looks Beyond Bitcoin to Nvidia and Oil: Can PURR Benefit?', \\\"Hyperliquid Looks Beyond Bitcoin to Nvidia and Oil: Can PURR Benefit?\\\\nHyperliquid CEO Jeff Yan described the platform's expansion to Nvidia and crude-oil perpetual futures and its market-listing mechanism, which requires deployers to stake 500,000 HYPE. The article also discusses oracle safeguards a\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a1404c-0b4c-7bd2-8dd7-25b11473fb28', 'benzinga.com', 'Why Is SMCI Stock Falling on Thursday?', 'Why Is SMCI Stock Falling on Thursday?\\\\nA contractor linked to Super Micro pleaded guilty last Thursday to conspiring to violate U.S. export controls, smuggling, defrauding the government, and obstructing justice in a case involving an alleged $2.5 billion scheme to export servers containing Nvidia c')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a14084-d6e8-7720-8c1e-816113184003', 'benzinga.com', 'Adobe And Nvidia Expand Partnership To Optimize Photoshop, Premiere, Substance 3D, Frame.io And Brand Concierge With Faster AI-Powered Creation, Production And Personalization', 'Adobe And Nvidia Expand Partnership To Optimize Photoshop, Premiere, Substance 3D, Frame.io And Brand Concierge With Faster AI-Powered Creation, Production And Personalization\\\\nAdobe and NVIDIA expanded their partnership to optimize Adobe creative applications, including Photoshop, Premiere and Subst')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a140da-f70d-7a20-9e0e-fd0196f6ad3e', 'benzinga.com', 'AI Stocks Plunge, but Jensen Huang Says Nvidia Gets New Chip Orders Almost Daily', 'AI Stocks Plunge, but Jensen Huang Says Nvidia Gets New Chip Orders Almost Daily\\\\nNvidia CEO Jensen Huang said customer orders for AI chips continue to exceed available supply, with new orders arriving almost weekly and daily. He cited electricity, data-center, and component constraints on supply exp')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a140ec-b901-7932-8d7c-b40caac13fab', 'benzinga.com', 'CoreWeave Stock Snaps Back as Nvidia CEO Signals Support', 'CoreWeave Stock Snaps Back as Nvidia CEO Signals Support\\\\nCoreWeave shares rebounded after Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang publicly expressed support, following a 15% drop the prior day. The rebound occurred alongside worsening credit signals: its 2031 bond yield rose to 15.78% and five-year CDS spreads brie')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a1412c-1c0f-7770-a882-5db9b802feff', 'benzinga.com', 'CoreWeave’s Bonds Hit 15% Yield: This Analyst Still Sees 105% Upside For The Stock', 'CoreWeave’s Bonds Hit 15% Yield: This Analyst Still Sees 105% Upside For The Stock\\\\nCoreWeave shares fell about 16% as yields on its 2031 and 2032 bonds rose close to 15%; its 2032 bond yield exceeded 15.4% and its 2031 bond yield exceeded 15.3%. Bank of America reiterated its Buy rating and $140 tar')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a14411-2fbc-7cc1-8f2d-ff5fbbc10305', 'benzinga.com', 'Taiwan Semiconductor Holds the Cards As NVIDIA, Apple and AMD Battle for Limited AI Chip Capacity', 'Taiwan Semiconductor Holds the Cards As NVIDIA, Apple and AMD Battle for Limited AI Chip Capacity\\\\nTaiwan Semiconductor reported Q3 revenue of $46.7 billion, up 16.2% sequentially and above the high end of guidance. AI-related demand and competition for wafer and advanced-packaging capacity remain st')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a1443d-5c99-76e3-a3a6-c9f242ae0c5a', 'benzinga.com', \\\"CoreWeave Stock Gets Hammered by Debt Fears, Analyst Says There's More to the Story\\\", \\\"CoreWeave Stock Gets Hammered by Debt Fears, Analyst Says There's More to the Story\\\\nCoreWeave shares sold off as yields on its 2031 and 2032 bonds rose above 15%, with its 2032 bond yielding more than 15.4% and trading near 78 cents on the dollar. Analysts discussed financing risks and growth foreca\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a1449b-f96b-7070-b1fb-93909948c3e4', 'benzinga.com', 'Nvidia Announces RTX Spark AI Laptops Available Today From ASUS, Dell, HP, Lenovo, Microsoft, And MSI', 'Nvidia Announces RTX Spark AI Laptops Available Today From ASUS, Dell, HP, Lenovo, Microsoft, And MSI\\\\nNvidia announced RTX Spark AI laptops are available today from ASUS, Dell, HP, Lenovo, Microsoft, and MSI.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a1460b-73ab-7910-a82f-e8aaf109ccd5', 'benzinga.com', 'Super Micro Finally Names a CFO, Nearly Two Years After an Accounting Review Prompted the Search', 'Super Micro Finally Names a CFO, Nearly Two Years After an Accounting Review Prompted the Search\\\\nSuper Micro appointed former Western Digital CFO Mark Long as its CFO, effective immediately, replacing David Weigand. The appointment follows a prolonged search prompted by accounting and governance scr')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a14771-019a-7530-b45b-f6bda58d95ea', 'benzinga.com', \\\"The Moment Jensen Huang Realized Nvidia 'Won't Have to Die' Came After a Call From This CEO: 'For the Whole Time, 30 Years…'\\\", \\\"The Moment Jensen Huang Realized Nvidia 'Won't Have to Die' Came After a Call From This CEO: 'For the Whole Time, 30 Years…'\\\\nTSMC reported third-quarter revenue of $46.72 billion, up 41.2% year over year and 16.2% sequentially, beating analyst estimates of $45.62 billion. Gross margin was 66.4%.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a14eab-e077-79e3-a6a9-6fc6f4643e85', 'benzinga.com', 'iPhone Duo Preorders, AAPL Crosses $5 Trillion and More: This Week in Appleverse', 'iPhone Duo Preorders, AAPL Crosses $5 Trillion and More: This Week in Appleverse\\\\nReports say Apple’s iPhone Duo sold out within minutes of preorders opening, and Apple shares climbed more than 2% in premarket trading Friday. The article also reports Apple’s market capitalization first closed above $')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a152e1-985a-7b80-b7b7-7193f8deba5a', 'benzinga.com', 'Santander Agrees Three-Year Collaboration Framework With Nvidia, Marking New AI Milestone And Building Capabilities On Nvidia AI Infrastructure', 'Santander Agrees Three-Year Collaboration Framework With Nvidia, Marking New AI Milestone And Building Capabilities On Nvidia AI Infrastructure\\\\nThe headline reports that Santander agreed to a three-year collaboration framework with Nvidia. The available article text provides no details on the framew')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a152ff-6ca6-73b3-b4b8-e5aa02712da6', 'benzinga.com', 'Samsung Turns to Rival TSMC for Nvidia’s Next-Generation Memory—Micron, SK Hynix Face Same Request: Report', \\\"Samsung Turns to Rival TSMC for Nvidia’s Next-Generation Memory—Micron, SK Hynix Face Same Request: Report\\\\nA report citing industry sources says Samsung accepted Nvidia's request to use TSMC's 3-nanometer process for the base die in Nvidia's custom NVHBM memory. This reported supplier/process arrang\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a153b1-c4fb-7dd3-9f2c-ba8556416f4c', 'benzinga.com', \\\"AI Boom Hits a Power Wall: Microsoft Walks Away From Nscale's UK Data Center Deal\\\", \\\"AI Boom Hits a Power Wall: Microsoft Walks Away From Nscale's UK Data Center Deal\\\\nMicrosoft withdrew from Nscale’s planned 50-megawatt data center project in Loughton, Essex, amid uncertainty about electricity supply; Reuters, citing the Telegraph, reported that grid power was not expected until the\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a155c5-f873-7dc2-864b-26af2754393f', 'benzinga.com', 'Amazon Just Found a Way Around Nvidia’s Biggest Moat', 'Amazon Just Found a Way Around Nvidia’s Biggest Moat\\\\nAmazon introduced TorchNeuron, an open-source tool that lets developers run PyTorch-based AI code on Trainium chips with minimal modifications. The release is intended to lower switching friction against Nvidia’s CUDA ecosystem; broader adoption a')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a15834-2f08-7b80-84ed-c78b73c7b611', 'benzinga.com', 'Big Short Investor Flags Major Vulnerability for Nvidia — 5 Customers Account for 70% of Receivables: ‘Tremendous Amount of Concentration Risk’', 'Big Short Investor Flags Major Vulnerability for Nvidia — 5 Customers Account for 70% of Receivables: ‘Tremendous Amount of Concentration Risk’\\\\nNvidia’s recent Form 10-Q reported that five unnamed direct customers represented 70% of accounts receivable. Steve Eisman cited this disclosed concentratio')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a158b7-06be-71c1-9a14-88f0a2bc47cb', 'benzinga.com', \\\"'ByteDance, Alibaba, Tencent Place Over $35 Billion Worth of Nvidia Chip Orders' - Reuters Exclusive\\\", \\\"'ByteDance, Alibaba, Tencent Place Over $35 Billion Worth of Nvidia Chip Orders' - Reuters Exclusive\\\\nReuters-reported exclusive says ByteDance, Alibaba, and Tencent ordered more than 3 million Nvidia RTX PRO 5500 workstation GPUs, worth over $35 billion; the chips reportedly comply with U.S. export \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a15904-0afd-7b43-b9d3-b4bb3186b510', 'benzinga.com', 'ByteDance, Alibaba, Tencent Place Massive $35 Billion NVIDIA Order', 'ByteDance, Alibaba, Tencent Place Massive $35 Billion NVIDIA Order\\\\nThe provider summary reports that NVIDIA received more than $35 billion in AI chip orders from ByteDance, Alibaba, and Tencent. The article body is unavailable, so order status and details cannot be independently assessed.')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a15c18-8b68-7f43-8ce1-994694946af2', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Nvidia Stock Pops After Hours As Elon Musk Says SpaceX Is Adding 200,000 Chips a Month — Daniel Newman Says NVDA Is 'Ripping'\\\", \\\"Nvidia Stock Pops After Hours As Elon Musk Says SpaceX Is Adding 200,000 Chips a Month — Daniel Newman Says NVDA Is 'Ripping'\\\\nSpaceX CEO Elon Musk said the company is tracking to bring roughly 200,000 Nvidia GB300 GPUs online monthly for the rest of the year. Nvidia shares rose 2.09% in extended tra\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a15cab-ca25-7fe2-bc2f-dbcd33c01d89', 'benzinga.com', \\\"SpaceX Can't Find Spare Nvidia, Google or Amazon Chips Despite Billions to Spend, Strategist Terms It 'Pretty Insane'\\\", \\\"SpaceX Can't Find Spare Nvidia, Google or Amazon Chips Despite Billions to Spend, Strategist Terms It 'Pretty Insane'\\\\nSpaceX reported third-quarter revenue of $14.58 billion versus $12.74 billion expected and earnings of $0.35 per share versus $0.12 expected. Revenue rose 161% year over year, includ\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a15e41-8387-76d3-8f0f-0f759fccfc35', 'benzinga.com', 'Cadence Announces Availability Of AI Data Center In Munich, Integrating Cadence OnCloud, Nvidia Vera And Grace CPU Systems', 'Cadence Announces Availability Of AI Data Center In Munich, Integrating Cadence OnCloud, Nvidia Vera And Grace CPU Systems\\\\nCadence announced that its sovereign AI data center in Munich is available, integrating Cadence OnCloud and digital-twin technology with NVIDIA Vera and Grace CPU systems. The a')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a15e5c-2f75-71e2-bcde-143adb3e1dff', 'benzinga.com', \\\"NVDA, CRWV, NBIS and Crypto Miners Surge After Elon Musk Says Cloud Providers 'Don't Have Any' AI Compute\\\", \\\"NVDA, CRWV, NBIS and Crypto Miners Surge After Elon Musk Says Cloud Providers 'Don't Have Any' AI Compute\\\\nAfter Elon Musk said during SpaceX’s third-quarter earnings call that cloud providers had no AI compute capacity available to rent, related stocks rose in pre-market trading. NVDA gained 2.17%, \\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a15fbb-d1c9-7101-b73c-0af5aab9acd5', 'benzinga.com', \\\"Amazon's Nvidia Chips Are Sitting in Warehouses Without Power as AI Spending Soars, Business Insider Reports\\\", \\\"Amazon's Nvidia Chips Are Sitting in Warehouses Without Power as AI Spending Soars, Business Insider Reports\\\\nAmazon is buying billions of dollars in Nvidia AI hardware, while some new server racks are reportedly waiting in warehouses for power.\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a1632b-6b09-7f50-8ac4-a2fa6a6699d2', 'marketscreener.com', 'NVIDIA and Tesla to Invest $2.8 Billion in Samsung Electro-Mechanics', 'NVIDIA and Tesla to Invest $2.8 Billion in Samsung Electro-Mechanics\\\\n[provider summary, not the article]\\\\nNvidia and Tesla reportedly plan a combined investment of 3.7 trillion South Korean won ($2.80 billion) in Samsung Electro-Mechanics to expand advanced semiconductor substrate production. The inv')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a16362-4700-7a82-829c-7ebd0a2262ba', 'tradingview.com', 'LG Innotek Partners with NVIDIA for HSB-Enabled Sensing Solutions', 'LG Innotek said it is collaborating with NVIDIA to build HSB-enabled sensing solutions, unveiling a 3MP camera module and Multi-modal Vision System at GTC Berlin, with plans to expand into humanoid robot components and showcase more at CES and GTC next year.\\\\nLinks LG Innotek to NVIDIA’s physical AI ')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a163d0-31d0-7421-8e06-4081a45c69ea', 'markets.businessinsider.com', 'Zadara Achieves NVIDIA AI Cloud Ready Validation', 'Oct. 22, 2026, 08:02 AM\\\\nIrvine, Calif., Oct. 22, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Zadara , a leading provider of sovereign AI cloud infrastructure, today announced it has achieved NVIDIA AI Cloud Ready ISV Initiative validated partner status, part of the NVIDIA Cloud Partner (NCP) program. Zadara will mark ')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a16422-8522-7fc1-8724-874e96196cc4', 'newswire.ca', 'Rockwell Automation Adds Support for NVIDIA Nemotron Models', \\\"Rockwell Automation, Inc.\\\\nManufacturers gain additional deployment flexibility for industrial AI orchestration through support for NVIDIA Nemotron models\\\\nMILWAUKEE , Oct. 22, 2026 /CNW/ -- Rockwell Automation, Inc. (NYSE: ROK), the world's largest company dedicated to industrial automation and digit\\\")\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a16851-902e-7540-b254-7fcf3e9992b4', 'datacentremagazine.com', 'Vertiv and NVIDIA Launch New AI Factory Deployment Approach', 'GTC: How Vertiv and NVIDIA Halve AI Factory Deployment Time\\\\nBy Saffron Humphreys\\\\nVertiv and NVIDIA have launched a new AI factory deployment approach at NVIDIA GTC Berlin.\\\\nThe model cuts infrastructure deployment time from approximately 90 days to 45 days, up to 50% faster, by shifting more assembly')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a17327-aeda-7362-b65e-a4680d120bbd', 'technews.tw', 'Supermicro and Nokia Deploy NVIDIA Aerial RAN Computer Solutions for AI-RAN', 'Supermicro and Nokia Deploy NVIDIA Aerial RAN Computer Solutions for AI-RAN\\\\n[provider summary, not the article]\\\\nSupermicro and Nokia are deploying NVIDIA Aerial RAN Computer solutions for AI-RAN workloads at the network edge. Supermicro says its servers for NVIDIA ARC are now available; some describ')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a177c4-aed3-7d01-b3d7-63d36293229a', 'prnewswire.com', 'SWI Compute Launches to Build NVIDIA AI Factories', 'SWI Compute Emerges from Stealth to Turn Gigawatts of Power Into NVIDIA AI Factories, Starting in Europe\\\\nSINGAPORE and AMSTERDAM , Oct. 26, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- SWI Compute today emerged from stealth to build and operate NVIDIA AI factories, launching first in Europe. The global AI infrastructure co')\\n('truenorth:story:story_01a178bc-293b-7301-baac-5776ecf91e91', 'morningstar.com', 'NVIDIA Expresses Interest in Meta Platforms Equity Offering', 'Nvidia, AMD and Broadcom could buy Meta shares as part of $35 billion stock offering\\\\nBy Britney Nguyen\\\\nMeta is looking to raise a total of $95 billion through stock-related deals that stretch into early next year\\\\nMeta announced a $35 billion equity offering on Monday.\\\\nMeta Platforms intends to raise')\\n('extra:b23f73a08a535993119430f5', 'cnbc.com', 'CNBC | VERSANT Press Room', 'CNBC | VERSANT Press Room\\\\nBrands\\\\nVersant Media\\\\nMS NOW\\\\nUSA Network\\\\nSYFY\\\\nRotten Tomatoes\\\\nUSA Sports\\\\nOxygen True Crime\\\\nE!\\\\nFandango\\\\nFreeTV\\\\nGolf Channel\\\\nGolfPass\\\\nGolfNow\\\\nFull Swing\\\\nLogin\\\\nRegister\\\\nLOADING...\\\\nPress Releases Photos Contacts\\\\nMore\\\\nPress Releases Photos Contacts\\\\nLOADING...\\\\nCNBC Transcript: Nvi')\\n('extra:1d912c1e5fc3a34f3c5bc52a', 'cnbc.com', 'CNBC | VERSANT Press Room', 'Brands\\\\nVersant Media\\\\nMS NOW\\\\nUSA Network\\\\nSYFY\\\\nRotten Tomatoes\\\\nUSA Sports\\\\nOxygen True Crime\\\\nE!\\\\nFandango\\\\nFreeTV\\\\nGolf Channel\\\\nGolfPass\\\\nGolfNow\\\\nFull Swing\\\\nLogin\\\\nRegister\\\\nLOADING...\\\\nPress Releases Photos Contacts\\\\nMore\\\\nPress Releases Photos Contacts\\\\nLOADING...\\\\nCNBC | VERSANT Press Room\\\\nCNBC Excerpts: Nvidi')\\n('extra:ea981681c9e20cb5e31f7126', 'blogs.nvidia.com', 'NVIDIA to Acquire Hugging Face | NVIDIA Blog', 'I’m excited to announce that NVIDIA has agreed to acquire Hugging Face for $12,930,300,000. Together, we will scale Hugging Face’s platform, strengthen its infrastructure and expand access to AI for developers and institutions worldwide.\\\\nOver the past decade, Clem, Julien, Thomas and the team at Hug')\\n('extra:ed34d148788e5d6f51faf5b5', 'blogs.nvidia.com', '‘Now We Can Know Everything and Do Anything,’ Jensen Huang Says at Dreamforce | NVIDIA Blog', 'At Dreamforce, Salesforce and NVIDIA announced Koa, a CRM reasoning model for Agentforce, post-trained from Nemotron on 27 years of Salesforce CRM intelligence — and running entirely within Salesforce’s own infrastructure.\\\\nThat was the message NVIDIA founder and CEO Jensen Huang brought to Salesforc')\\n('extra:e85b9e2ad448ed75ecf99831', 'blogs.nvidia.com', 'NVIDIA, Microsoft Kick Off a New Beginning for Windows PCs with RTX Spark and AI Agents | NVIDIA Blog', 'RTX Spark preorders open today alongside a preview of NVIDIA DGX Station for Windows, the first deskside AI supercomputer built for the Windows enterprise desktop.\\\\nAt a Microsoft event in San Francisco on Wednesday, NVIDIA founder and CEO Jensen Huang and Microsoft CEO Satya Nadella outlined how NVI')\\n('extra:494a9fa3bb713759384d4568', 'blogs.nvidia.com', 'Germany Wants to Lead the World in Industrial AI: How NVIDIA Will Help | NVIDIA Blog', 'German Chancellor Friedrich Merz and NVIDIA founder and CEO Jensen Huang discussed how to merge traditional German engineering with state-of-the-art AI.\\\\nIn the cavernous hall of Kraftwerk, a former power station in Berlin, German Chancellor Friedrich Merz and NVIDIA founder and CEO Jensen Huang sat ')\\n('extra:99d146f2162c85d645ba0fbd', 'investor.nvidia.com', 'NVIDIA Corporation - NVIDIA and MediaTek Deepen Long-Standing Partnership to Build AI Edge to Cloud Computing Platforms', 'NVIDIA Corporation - NVIDIA and MediaTek Deepen Long-Standing Partnership to Build AI Edge to Cloud Computing Platforms\\\\nNVIDIA and MediaTek Deepen Long-Standing Partnership to Build AI Edge to Cloud Computing Platforms\\\\nAugust 31, 2026\\\\nCompanies Expand Collaboration Across Multigenerational Cloud AI ')\\n('extra:2799d8731e89b90c9bd3f108', 'investor.nvidia.com', 'NVIDIA Corporation - NVIDIA Announces Financial Results for Second Quarter Fiscal 2027', 'NVIDIA Corporation - NVIDIA Announces Financial Results for Second Quarter Fiscal 2027\\\\nNVIDIA Announces Financial Results for Second Quarter Fiscal 2027\\\\nAugust 26, 2026\\\\nRevenue of $96.2 billion, up 106% from a year ago\\\\nData Center revenue of $89.0 billion, up 117% from a year ago\\\\nSANTA CLARA, Calif.')\\nv5 NVIDIA expects total revenue to grow approximately 70% in FY2028, with supply constraining growth. We expect to grow revenue by approximately 70% in fiscal 2028. This is a supply-constrained outlook.\\nv8 NVIDIA Data Center revenue was $89 billion in Q2 FY2027, up 18% sequentially. Q2 data center revenue increased 18% quarter-over-quarter to $89 billion with strong contributions from both sub segments hyperscale and ACIE, which includes our NeoCloud, industrial and enterprise customers.\\nv8 NVIDIA hyperscale revenue was $49 billion in Q2 FY2027, up 13% sequentially, driven by Blackwell. Hyperscale revenue of $49 billion grew 13% sequentially, driven by sustained strength in Blackwell\\nv6,v7 NVIDIA said cloud-industry backlog exceeds $2 trillion and top-five hyperscaler CapEx is expected to approach $800 billion in 2026 and $1.3 trillion in 2027. With cloud industry backlog now greater than $2 trillion, CapEx by the top 5 hyperscalers is expected to reach nearly $800 billion in 2026 and $1.3 trillion in 2027.\\nv3,v4,v5,v8 AWS plans to deploy an additional 2 million NVIDIA GPUs, along with Vera CPUs, from Q2 FY2027 through Q2 FY2029. AWS is deploying an additional 2 million GPUs starting this quarter through the second quarter of fiscal '29 along with Vera, CPUs, some integrated with Rubin, other standalone.\\nv4,v5,v8 AWS plans to serve NVIDIA’s Nemotron open-model family on Amazon Bedrock and SageMaker. AWS will serve NVIDIA Nemotron family of open models on Amazon Bedrock and SageMaker.\\nv8 e2295 Morningstar cites NVIDIA Data Center revenue of $3 billion in FY2020 and $194 billion in FY2026, and estimates $361 billion in FY2027, up 86% year over year. Nvidia’s DC business has achieved exponential growth already, rising from $3 billion in fiscal 2020 to $194 billion in fiscal 2026, and we estimate it will be $361 billion in fiscal 2027, representing 86% annual growth. {'input_id': 'gnews:7ce47efd62fa17b9aa29e258', 'title': 'Going Into Earnings, Is Nvidia Stock a Buy, a Sell, or Fairly Valued?', 'source_uri': 'https://www.morningstar.com/stocks/going-into-earnings-is-nvidia-stock-buy-sell-or-fairly-valued-8'}\\nv8 e5309 NVIDIA reported $164 billion of Data Center segment revenue in the first six months of FY2027. The company has generated $164 billion in revenue from its data center segment in the first six months of fiscal 2027. {'input_id': 'gnews:ad94c78d09fe41fc3f29bbca', 'title': 'Global AI Infrastructure Spending Will Hit $31.6 Trillion by 2050. This Is the Stock That Could Benefit the Most', 'source_uri': 'https://www.fool.com/investing/2026/09/18/global-ai-infrastructure-spending-will-hit-usd31-6-trillion-by-2050-this-is-the-stock-that-could-benefit-the-most/'}\\nv4,v8 e5384 Nscale signed a six-year agreement in August 2026 for Anthropic to lease capacity at Nscale’s West Virginia data center, valued at up to $45 billion. Last month, Nscale signed a landmark agreement with Anthropic to lease capacity at its flagship data center in West Virginia. The six-year deal is valued at up to $45 billion. {'input_id': 'gnews:a7ac49717831582bc5bb87db', 'title': 'NVIDIA-backed \\\"British Oracle\\\" Races for U.S. IPO with $35 Billion Valuation Target', 'source_uri': 'https://www.moomoo.com/news/post/76493332/nvidia-backed-british-oracle-races-for-us-ipo-with-35'}\\nv4,v8 e5385 Nscale estimated that its West Virginia data center, including a 2 GW gas-fired power plant, would cost about $70 billion and begin phased commissioning by the end of 2027. Nscale estimates that this data center, currently under construction, is expected to begin phased commissioning by the end of next year, with a total cost of approximately US$70 billion, including a 2 GW natural-gas-fired power plant to support its operations. {'input_id': 'gnews:a7ac49717831582bc5bb87db', 'title': 'NVIDIA-backed \\\"British Oracle\\\" Races for U.S. IPO with $35 Billion Valuation Target', 'source_uri': 'https://www.moomoo.com/news/post/76493332/nvidia-backed-british-oracle-races-for-us-ipo-with-35'}\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\nsrc/hivemind/views/store.py:105:def add_key(conn, view_id, key, seq):\nsrc/hivemind/views/store.py:159:def view_key(conn, view_id):\nsrc/hivemind/views/store.py:171:def open_views_wi