g'\\\\'',db.execute('\\\\''select count(*) from evidence where evidence_id not in (select evidence_id from evidence_sources)'\\\\'').fetchone()[0])\n print('\\\\''skipped reason count'\\\\'',db.execute(\\\"select count(*) from view_switches where reason='\\\\''created'\\\\''\\\").fetchone()[0], '\\\\''occurrences in data'\\\\'',sum('\\\\''created'\\\\'' in s for s in flat))\n print('\\\\''hits'\\\\'',collections.Counter(h['\\\\''field'\\\\''] for h in diag['\\\\''hits'\\\\'']))\n cols={r[1] for r in db.execute('\\\\''pragma table_info(view_keys)'\\\\'')}\n if cols:\n  print('\\\\''keys different seq'\\\\'',db.execute('\\\\''select count(*) from view_keys k join views v using(view_id) where k.seq\"'!=v.created_seq'\"'\\\\'').fetchone()[0])\n conditions={r[0] for q in d['\\\\''questions'\\\\''] if q['\\\\''class'\\\\'']\"'!='\"'\\\\''number'\\\\'' for r in db.execute('\\\\''select condition from rungs where view_id=?'\\\\'',(q['\\\\''id'\\\\''],)) if r[0]}\n joined='\\\\''\\\\x01'\\\\''.join(flat); hits=[c for c in conditions if c in joined];print('\\\\''event conditions'\\\\'',len(conditions),'\\\\''matches'\\\\'',len(hits),hits[:3])\n if name=='\\\\''old-1'\\\\'':\n  print('\\\\''j865'\\\\'',tuple(db.execute('\\\\''select reasons,why_changed,implied_outcome from judgements where judgement_id=865'\\\\'').fetchone()))\n  close=release.read_data(base/name/'\\\\''closing/package'\\\\'');v8=next(q for q in close['\\\\''questions'\\\\''] if q['\\\\''id'\\\\'']=='\\\\''v8'\\\\'');hits=[(e['\\\\''id'\\\\''],k,v[:85]) for e in v8['\\\\''evidence'\\\\''] for k,v in [('\\\\''quote'\\\\'',e['\\\\''quote'\\\\'']),('\\\\''one_line'\\\\'',e['\\\\''one_line'\\\\'']),('\\\\''title'\\\\'',e['\\\\''sources'\\\\''][0]['\\\\''title'\\\\''])] if isinstance(v,str) and '\\\\''Bullish'\\\\'' in v]\n  print('\\\\''closing'\\\\'',len(hits),hits[:3])\n'\"","aggregated_output":"old-1 all data 91008 manifest 4 searched 82641 nulls {} ratios 0.3998079640096209 1.239567233384853\ndb (5390, 5390) missing 0\nskipped reason count 47 occurrences in data 21\nhits Counter({'sources[0].title': 340, 'quote': 51})\nkeys different seq 0\nevent conditions 54 matches 0 []\nj865 ('The reference is rung 2 (No): no market consensus is supplied, so the status-quo expectation is that the investment has not completed by December 31, 2026. Against that reference, the specific report that NVIDIA has indicated interest in about US$500 million of preference shares, intended to convert at Firmus’ IPO later in 2026, makes completion by the deadline more likely than non-completion. The report is an indication of interest, not a confirmed commitment, so it does not make completion certain; the updated AI-capex themes modestly support the financing context but do not establish this transaction.', 'The rung remains 1 and no new transaction terms are shown. The updated AI-capex themes now put 2026 hyperscaler data-center capex at rung 4 and 2027 capex at rung 4, strengthening the contextual support for Firmus financing and changing the supporting outlook, without changing the implied completion date.', 'Completion of the indicated approximately US$500 million preference-share investment by December 31, 2026 is more likely than non-completion. The report ties the preference shares to conversion at Firmus’ IPO later in 2026, placing the intended transaction before the deadline, though it does not confirm that NVIDIA has committed.')\nclosing 6 [('e1484', 'title', 'Can Nvidia Reclaim $5 Trillion? Jensen Huang’s Bullish AI Call Says Yes'), ('e1485', 'title', 'Can Nvidia Reclaim $5 Trillion? Jensen Huang’s Bullish AI Call Says Yes'), ('e1865', 'quote', 'Bullish confirmation would require firm procurement commitments for the SpaceX buildo')]\nold-2 all data 69593 manifest 4 searched 63181 nulls {} ratios 0.3722650333987713 1.257606490872211\ndb (5102, 5102) missing 0\nskipped reason count 43 occurrences in data 12\nhits Counter({'sources[0].title': 240, 'quote': 15})\nkeys different seq 0\nev